<title>FINLAND: Tieto 9-mth profit doubles.</title>
<headline>Tieto 9-mth profit doubles.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to end-Sept, 1996</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax   133.7 vs 65.4</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   9.38 vs 7.53</p>
<p> Net sales					1,436.0 vs 805.2</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of forecasts for Finnish data systems group TT Tieto Oy was for a 124 million markka profit and 9.05 markka earnings per share.</p>
</text>
